(;B[eq]C[John_C\: Xinqun is a strong European 4dan player. He has only played a few games against European players outside of Ireland, but has beaten some very strong players such as Cornel Burzo 6dan and Koichiro Habu 5dan. Xinqun’s only foreign tournament was the US Go Congress in 2022, finishing with 8/9 and a 6dan AGA rating performance.
]
