(;W[co]C[John_C\: Larion is a rapidly improving player. Last year, he was rated 8kyu on OGS, but now plays as a 7dan on Fox. He is the highest rated U11 in Europe. He is 8 years old. 
John_C\: Larion won the first game by 4.5 points, but then Xinqun struck back to win the second by 1.5! Two extremely close games so far. The score is tied now and the winner of this game will become Irish Champion
]
